  "source": "function identity(index) { return index }\nfunction run_mapping(distribution, shape)\n{\n    var checksum = 0\n    for (let repetition in 0 to 256) {\n        let mapped = finite::map(distribution, shape, identity)\n        checksum = checksum + int(finite::prob(mapped, finite::index([0])) * 128.0)\n    }\n    return checksum + 0\n}\nlet distribution = finite::uniform(128)\nlet shape = finite::index([128])\nlet started = clock_ns()\nlet checksum = run_mapping(distribution, shape)\nlet elapsed = clock_ns() - started\nprint(checksum)\nprint(elapsed)\n",
